From f5a474c460beca40833f5d19e547240aa3f22d59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 05:53:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add trainer-only "Anketa" view showing the client's
 onboarding answers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New ClientInfo.js renders every field the client filled in during
Onboarding — birth date, gender, height/weight, goal, motivation,
sleep/stress note, activity level, step-count target, diet
description, hardest part, expectations, and their self-rated
wellbeing — grouped into the same sections as the onboarding flow,
with human-readable labels instead of raw stored codes.

Exported STEPS_OPTS and a new WELLBEING_OPTS from Onboarding.js so
ClientInfo can look up labels from the same source instead of
duplicating them.

Wired in via a new "Anketa" button alongside Matavimai/Nuotraukos on
the trainer's client detail screen. It's only imported from
AdminPanel.js — nothing in the client-facing screens references it,
so the client cannot reach this view.
---
 src/AdminPanel.js |  10 ++++-
 src/ClientInfo.js | 104 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/Onboarding.js |  19 +++++----
 3 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/ClientInfo.js

